					"id": 411260801,
					"content": "在这里，应该就能看清楚陨石了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 411260802,
					"content": "有封信给你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411260803,
					"content": "爸爸写给我的信…唔，我大概知道里面写了什么…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 411260804,
					"content": "肯定是说，他又因为工作没法回来陪我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 411260805,
					"content": "那些千岩军叔叔过来的时候，我还以为爸爸也会一起来呢，结果他还是没来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 411260806,
					"content": "不过也好，那么多大石头从天上掉下来，要是爸爸在野外的话，说不定会有危险。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260807,
						411260809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 411260807,
					"content": "你害怕吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260808
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411260808,
					"content": "嗯…有一点点，但是有千岩军叔叔在这里呢，不会有问题的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 411260811,
					"content": "对了，那你帮我把这封信送给爸爸吧，他肯定担心我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 411260812,
					"content": "唉…真奇怪，爸爸每次说要请假回来陪我的时候，都会出点事让他没法回来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 411260809,
					"content": "别去野外。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411260810,
					"content": "我知道，那些千岩军叔叔不知道说了多少遍了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411260811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				}
			]
